# Superstore Sales Analytics Dashboard

## Project Overview
This project is an interactive Sales Analytics Dashboard built using Microsoft Power BI and the Sample Superstore dataset.
It helps analyze sales performance, profitability, order volume, and customer segments.

## Project Objectives
- Analyze total sales and total profit.
- Monitor total orders and profit margin.
- Explore monthly sales trends.
- Compare sales across product categories and customer segments.
- Filter business performance by year and region.

## Tools and Technologies
- Microsoft Power BI Desktop
- DAX (Data Analysis Expressions)
- Power Query (if used for data preparation)

## Dashboard Features
- KPI cards for Total Sales, Total Profit, Total Orders, and Profit Margin.
- Monthly Sales Trend visualization.
- Sales analysis by product category.
- Sales analysis by customer segment.
- Interactive Year and Region slicers.

## Dataset
The dashboard uses the Sample Superstore dataset, which contains order dates, product details, customer segments, regions,
sales, discounts, quantities, and profit.

